---
import PageLayout from "@layouts/PageLayout.astro";
import Container from "@components/Container.astro";
---

<PageLayout title="About" description="About Ahad, an IT support specialist moving into networking.">
  <Container>
    <div class="space-y-10">
      <div class="animate font-semibold text-black dark:text-white">
        About me
      </div>
      <article class="space-y-4">
        <p class="animate">
          I've been the go-to IT person for my family, friends, neighbors and pretty much
          everybody around me for over ten years, fixing computers, setting up networks and
          figuring things out the hard way.
        </p>
        <p class="animate">
          Today I work as an IT support specialist, and I'm building on that with CompTIA A+,
          Microsoft Azure Fundamentals and Security, Compliance and Identity Fundamentals
          certifications. I love keeping up with the latest in tech.
        </p>
        <p class="animate">
          Home labs are my hobby. That's where I try out new tools and practice networking for
          real, with segmented VLANs, firewall rules and scheduled access. I'm also working on
          web coding projects, including building this website myself.
        </p>
        <p class="animate">
          I'm now studying for Network+ and looking for a networking role where I can keep
          growing. Next up in my home lab: a Pi-hole for network-wide ad blocking, Home Assistant
          for smart home automation, and my own DNS server.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </Container>
</PageLayout>
